    feat(12.2): implement TopCV scraper with anti-bot search + detail parsing
    
    Implements the full topcv.scrape capability:
    - Fetches TopCV search pages with StealthyFetcher (Cloudflare/anti-bot handling).
    - Parses job cards for title, company, location, salary, experience, posted date.
    - Crawls detail pages via WebCrawlerConnector and extracts job description,
      requirements, skills, location, and employment type from markdown sections.
    - Normalizes salary (Thoả thuận / numeric VND/USD), experience years, and
      relative posted-at timestamps.
    - Degrades gracefully on anti-bot blocks or timeouts.
    
    Adds unit tests (parser + orchestration) and a Playground E2E spec.
    
    Story 12.2 is marked done in sprint-status.yaml.

